    footSrc1: 'Unofficial search over three official publications: the ', footSrcM: 'Republican list of extremist materials', footSrc2: ' (Ministry of Information), the ', footSrcF: 'list of extremist formations', footSrc3: ' and the ', footSrcP: 'list of individuals involved in extremist activity', footSrc4: ' (Interior Ministry), plus the ', footSrcW: 'Russian Interior Ministry wanted database of Belarusians', footSrc5: ' (Mediazona Belarus’s daily extract). The database updates automatically.',
    footSrcWarn: 'The official sites, list files and official search may collect visitor data for Belarusian authorities — open them directly only knowingly.',
    footPrivacy: 'This site collects nothing: no queries, no cookies, no analytics. Search runs in your browser, the query never enters the address bar or history, the watchlist and settings stay on this device only, and the site works offline.',
    footCode1: 'Open source and static — you can host your own mirror. Bugs and ideas go to ', footCode2: 'GitHub Issues', footCode3: '.',
    privacy: 'This site collects no data: no queries, no cookies, no analytics. Search runs entirely in your browser and the query never enters the address bar or browser history; the watchlist and its settings (notifications, panel state), theme, language and sort order are kept only in this device’s localStorage, and the once-per-session consent to open links in sessionStorage until the tab is closed. The site also works offline — after the first visit a copy of the database stays in the browser.',
